    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110853" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλανθρωπ-εύομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>act humanely</i> or
				<i>courteously,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					19.139
				</span></i>
			: c. acc. rei, <i>to show kindness by granting</i> a thing,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				9.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				50.20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι περί τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					<u>Or.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				22
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ θαυμαστά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.234J.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Astrol., =
			sq. <i><span class="en">
				1.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Par.Ptol.</u>
				200
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc.
			pers., <i>treat humanely,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				13.2.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. τινά τι</span>
			<i>do</i> one a <i>kindness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				9.2
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλανθρωπευθέντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					18.18
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1457.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>conciliate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν δῆμον δώδεκα ἀποικίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					1.23
				</span></i>
			.</div>
